starting: a health check has not passed yet.
failed: no service runs, and one exited with an error, keeps restarting or is
  unhealthy.
partly running: some services run and others don't.
running: every service that has not finished is up.
stopped: 'treerig up' has finished before, and nothing runs now.
not started: 'treerig up' has not finished yet.
